  {
    "id": 4901700120010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私の行きたいお店か──\r\nまいったな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170012/4901700120010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、遠慮することないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日は存分に俺をお供にしてほしい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700120020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタという人は本当に……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170012/4901700120020"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00111",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700120030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "────…………\r\nとても時間がかかるかもしれないよ？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030060020",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490170012/4901700120030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どんとこいだ\r\nなんと、今日はこの後の予定がない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700120040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………\r\nいつまでも決められなくて、アナタを困らせるかもしれない",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170012/4901700120040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それなら心配いらないよ\r\nもしそうなったとしても、俺は困ったりしないから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いっぱい迷おう\r\n咲耶がピンとくるまで、いくつでも見て回ろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700120050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………\r\n男性には少し入りづらいところに行くかもしれないよ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170012/4901700120050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ……れは──いや、問題ない！\r\nどこでもOKだ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お供するって言ったからな\r\n時間が許す限り、どんなところへでも付き合うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700120060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ちょっとした意地悪に、\r\nそうまっすぐに返されると困ってしまうね",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170012/4901700120060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは、ごめんな\r\n困らせたかったわけではないんだけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、『どんなところへでも付き合う』\r\nというのは本気だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700120070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフッ……うん",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170012/4901700120070"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700120080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "降参だ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170012/4901700120080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、覚悟はできたか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700120090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
